            "value": "“Full Game Unlock” is a one-time purchase. It adds Exact Pose mode, the 16- and 20-card boards, and 70 more animal pictures: every friend playing, napping, waving, celebrating, playing football, playing golf and cooking. Classic mode with 6 and 12 cards stays free. No ads and no subscriptions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
